# Regression: menu open/close leaves no native-pixel stamp where the dropdown was.
# Motivating bug (Phase 2 checkpoints): closing the game menu used to leave blocky
# native pixels in the menu-bar band. m-before vs m-after must be pixel-identical in
# the top band; m-open must actually show the open dropdown. QFG1 target, save slot 1.
wait 4000
capture m-before
move 160 100
wait 600
key ESC
wait 1200
capture m-open
move 200 12
wait 600
key ESC
wait 1200
capture m-after
move 160 100
wait 600
quit
